        }
      ],
      "impact": "In PWM mode the M5Stack GPIOs drive the servo signal lines without the intended 1 kΩ current-limiting/buffering resistors, which can overload the GPIO or servo input and changes the board behavior from the intended design. In serial mode the bridge is also made on the un-buffered PWM nets.",
